  "worked_solution": "Let's start by writing the equation of the line as\n\n$$\nr=\u27e83+4t,5-t,9+6t\u27e9.\n$$\n\nLet's also write the equation of the plane in the dot product form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2x+4y+2z-16 & =0 \\\\ -2x+4y+2z & =16 \\\\ \u27e8x,y,z\u27e9\\cdot \u27e8-2,4,2\u27e9 & =16 \\\\ r\\cdot \u27e8-2,4,2\u27e9 & =16\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, substituting $r=\u27e83+4t,5-t,9+6t\u27e9$ into the equation of the plane, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot \u27e8-2,4,2\u27e9 & =16 \\\\ \u27e83+4t,5-t,9+6t\u27e9\\cdot \u27e8-2,4,2\u27e9 & =16 \\\\ -2(3+4t)+4(5-t)+2(9+6t) & =16 \\\\ -6-8t+20-4t+18+12t & =16 \\\\ 32 & =16.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation has no solution. Therefore, we conclude that the line $l$ and the plane $\u03a0$ do not intersect.",
